{"version": 2, "width": 140, "height": 32, "timestamp": 1792177185, "title": "One trusted operator: unsigned HTTP lifecycle"}
[0.13666, "o", "One trusted local operator; unsigned HTTP, not independent signed review.\r\n"]
[0.136721, "o", "A real server, isolated SQLite, no agent runtime or external service.\r\n"]
[4.136926, "o", "\r\n1. Define the Outcome and one required criterion\r\n"]
[4.137592, "o", "> POST /api/v1/namespaces/0199d000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001/outcomes\r\n"]
[4.14326, "o", "< HTTP 201\r\n"]
[4.143296, "o", "Outcome: 01a14615-b4e9-7321-86e5-b942832e11ac\r\n"]
[4.143305, "o", "Following request paths are relative to this Outcome.\r\n"]
[4.143561, "o", "> POST /criteria\r\n"]
[4.148856, "o", "< HTTP 201\r\n"]
[4.148901, "o", "{\r\n  \"criterion\": \"The guide contains installation and verification commands\",\r\n  \"required\": true\r\n}\r\n"]
[4.149028, "o", "> POST /actions/activate\r\n"]
[4.153296, "o", "< HTTP 200\r\n"]
[8.153536, "o", "\r\n2. Create and explicitly acquire one Task\r\n"]
[8.153887, "o", "> POST /work-items\r\n"]
[8.159085, "o", "< HTTP 201\r\n"]
[8.159391, "o", "> POST /work-items/01a14615-c498-7b84-a444-095c6055290c/actions/claim\r\n"]
[8.164741, "o", "< HTTP 200\r\n"]
[8.164797, "o", "{\r\n  \"task\": \"in_progress\",\r\n  \"fencing_token\": 1\r\n}\r\n"]
[12.164996, "o", "\r\n3. Execute outside WOS and record the delivered file\r\n"]
[12.165649, "o", "> POST /artifacts\r\n"]
[12.171235, "o", "< HTTP 201\r\n"]
[12.171422, "o", "> POST /work-items/01a14615-c498-7b84-a444-095c6055290c/actions/complete\r\n"]
[12.177295, "o", "< HTTP 200\r\n"]
[12.177639, "o", "> POST /evidence\r\n"]
[12.181247, "o", "< HTTP 201\r\n"]
[12.181291, "o", "{\r\n  \"task\": \"done\",\r\n  \"evidence\": \"inspection\"\r\n}\r\n"]
[16.181488, "o", "\r\n4. Confirm: delivery and Evidence did not achieve the Outcome\r\n"]
[16.18198, "o", "> GET /\r\n"]
[16.185944, "o", "< HTTP 200\r\n"]
[16.186, "o", "{\r\n  \"outcome\": \"active\"\r\n}\r\n"]
[20.186209, "o", "\r\n5. Explicitly assess the criterion against the inspected material\r\n"]
[20.186725, "o", "> POST /criteria/01a14615-b4ee-7e20-8fcb-7b3e4d23265b/assessments\r\n"]
[20.191512, "o", "< HTTP 201\r\n"]
[20.19156, "o", "{\r\n  \"assessment\": \"met\"\r\n}\r\n"]
[24.191726, "o", "\r\n6. Explicitly conclude the Outcome\r\n"]
[24.19212, "o", "> POST /actions/achieve\r\n"]
[24.202, "o", "< HTTP 200\r\n"]
[24.202066, "o", "{\r\n  \"outcome\": \"achieved\",\r\n  \"conclusion_id\": \"01a14616-033f-73ef-920c-0e792682335d\",\r\n  \"assessment_count\": 1\r\n}\r\n"]
[24.202077, "o", "The operator wrote and inspected the file; WOS stored state and checked transition rules.\r\n"]
